#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:2
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architektur"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:7
msgid ""
"Layouts 1.3 and 2.0 use the |morpheus| Agent's QuorumCheckService for "
"high availability. This architecture replaces the Pacemaker-based "
"resource management used by Legacy layouts, providing tighter integration"
" with the |morpheus| platform and simplified operations."
msgstr ""
"Die Layouts 1.3 und 2.0 verwenden den QuorumCheckService des |morpheus| "
"Agenten für Hochverfügbarkeit. Diese Architektur ersetzt die Pacemaker-basierte "
"Ressourcenverwaltung der Legacy-Layouts und bietet eine engere Integration "
"mit der |morpheus|-Plattform sowie vereinfachte Abläufe."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:9
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Hinweis"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:9
msgid ""
"This page applies to layouts 1.3 and 2.0. For the Pacemaker architecture "
"used by Legacy layouts, see :doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/mvm`."
msgstr ""
"Diese Seite gilt für die Layouts 1.3 und 2.0. Informationen zur Pacemaker-Architektur "
"der Legacy-Layouts finden Sie unter :doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/mvm`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:12
msgid "Component Stack"
msgstr "Komponentenstapel"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:14
msgid "Layouts 1.3 and 2.0 rely on three core components:"
msgstr "Die Layouts 1.3 und 2.0 basieren auf drei Kernkomponenten:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:16
msgid "**Corosync**: Cluster membership and messaging layer"
msgstr "**Corosync**: Cluster-Mitgliedschaft und Nachrichtenschicht"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:17
msgid ""
"**DLM (Distributed Lock Manager)**: Coordinates file locks for the HPE "
"Clustered Datastore (GFS2) filesystem"
msgstr ""
"**DLM (Distributed Lock Manager)**: Koordiniert Dateisperren für das HPE "
"Clustered Datastore (GFS2)-Dateisystem"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Morpheus Agent (QuorumCheckService)**: Quorum decisions, failure "
"detection, fencing, and recovery orchestration"
msgstr ""
"**Morpheus Agent (QuorumCheckService)**: Quorum-Entscheidungen, Fehlererkennung, "
"Fencing und Wiederherstellungsorchestrierung"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:21
msgid "Quorum Algorithm"
msgstr "Quorum-Algorithmus"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:23
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| agent on each host runs a QuorumCheckService that "
"continuously monitors cluster health and makes quorum decisions."
msgstr ""
"Der |morpheus|-Agent auf jedem Host führt einen QuorumCheckService aus, "
"der kontinuierlich den Cluster-Zustand überwacht und Quorum-Entscheidungen trifft."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:26
msgid "Peer Communication"
msgstr "Peer-Kommunikation"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:28
msgid "Each host exposes a ``/quorum`` endpoint on port 7443"
msgstr "Jeder Host stellt einen ``/quorum``-Endpunkt auf Port 7443 bereit"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:29
msgid "Hosts ping each other every 20 seconds"
msgstr "Hosts pingen sich gegenseitig alle 20 Sekunden an"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:30
msgid "A node is considered unreachable after 60 seconds with no response"
msgstr "Ein Knoten gilt nach 60 Sekunden ohne Antwort als nicht erreichbar"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:31
msgid ""
"Cross-verification: reachability is confirmed by a majority of same-site "
"peers"
msgstr ""
"Gegenprüfung: Die Erreichbarkeit wird von einer Mehrheit der Peers am selben "
"Standort bestätigt"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:34
msgid "Majority Calculation"
msgstr "Mehrheitsberechnung"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:36
msgid "The quorum algorithm uses a simple majority formula:"
msgstr "Der Quorum-Algorithmus verwendet eine einfache Mehrheitsformel:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:38
msgid "neededForQuorum = (totalNodes / 2) + 1"
msgstr "neededForQuorum = (totalNodes / 2) + 1"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:43
msgid "Quorum States"
msgstr "Quorum-Zustände"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:45
msgid "Each node operates in one of three states:"
msgstr "Jeder Knoten arbeitet in einem von drei Zuständen:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:51
msgid "State"
msgstr "Zustand"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:52
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:112
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beschreibung"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:53
msgid "Quorum Achieved"
msgstr "Quorum erreicht"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:54
msgid "A majority of cluster nodes are reachable. Normal operations continue."
msgstr "Eine Mehrheit der Cluster-Knoten ist erreichbar. Der normale Betrieb wird fortgesetzt."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:55
msgid "Quorum Lost"
msgstr "Quorum verloren"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:56
msgid ""
"The node cannot reach a majority of peers. The node self-fences to "
"protect data integrity."
msgstr ""
"Der Knoten kann keine Mehrheit der Peers erreichen. Der Knoten führt ein "
"Self-Fencing durch, um die Datenintegrität zu schützen."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:57
msgid "Fenced"
msgstr "Abgegrenzt (Fenced)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:58
msgid "The node has been fenced and is waiting for recovery."
msgstr "Der Knoten wurde abgegrenzt (fenced) und wartet auf die Wiederherstellung."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:61
msgid "Designated Coordinator"
msgstr "Designated Coordinator"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:63
msgid ""
"The cluster elects a Designated Coordinator from among the reachable "
"nodes. The coordinator is determined by the lowest hash of reachable host"
" key hashes (sorted alphabetically). Only the coordinator is authorized "
"to issue fencing operations."
msgstr ""
"Der Cluster wählt einen Designated Coordinator aus den erreichbaren Knoten. "
"Der Coordinator wird durch den niedrigsten Hash der erreichbaren Host-Schlüssel-Hashes "
"(alphabetisch sortiert) bestimmt. Nur der Coordinator ist berechtigt, "
"Fencing-Operationen auszulösen."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:66
msgid "Heartbeat Failover (MvmHeartbeatFailover)"
msgstr "Heartbeat-Failover (MvmHeartbeatFailover)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:68
msgid ""
"The heartbeat failover mechanism monitors host health via shared storage "
"and orchestrates VM recovery when a host fails."
msgstr ""
"Der Heartbeat-Failover-Mechanismus überwacht den Host-Zustand über gemeinsamen "
"Speicher und orchestriert die VM-Wiederherstellung bei einem Host-Ausfall."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:71
msgid "Heartbeat Writes"
msgstr "Heartbeat-Schreibvorgänge"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:73
msgid "Each host writes ``hb.properties`` to shared storage every 20 seconds"
msgstr "Jeder Host schreibt alle 20 Sekunden ``hb.properties`` auf den gemeinsamen Speicher"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:74
msgid "The heartbeat file contains hostname, memory statistics, and timestamp"
msgstr "Die Heartbeat-Datei enthält Hostname, Speicherstatistiken und Zeitstempel"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:75
msgid "VM XML definitions are written for all running VMs alongside the heartbeat"
msgstr "VM-XML-Definitionen werden für alle laufenden VMs zusammen mit dem Heartbeat geschrieben"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:78
msgid "Failure Detection"
msgstr "Fehlererkennung"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:80
msgid ""
"A host is considered offline after 140 seconds (7 missed heartbeat "
"intervals)"
msgstr ""
"Ein Host gilt nach 140 Sekunden (7 verpasste Heartbeat-Intervalle) als offline"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:81
msgid ""
"The Designated Coordinator assigns the failed host's VMs to surviving "
"hosts based on available memory"
msgstr ""
"Der Designated Coordinator weist die VMs des ausgefallenen Hosts basierend "
"auf dem verfügbaren Arbeitsspeicher den überlebenden Hosts zu"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:84
msgid "Storage Structure"
msgstr "Speicher-Struktur"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:86
msgid "Heartbeat data is stored on the HPE Clustered Datastore (Shared LUN) at:"
msgstr "Heartbeat-Daten werden auf dem HPE Clustered Datastore (Shared LUN) gespeichert unter:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:88
msgid ""
"<datastore>/mvm-hb/<cluster_uuid>-2/<host_hash>/\n"
"  ├── hb.properties\n"
"  ├── *.xml          (VM definitions)\n"
"  └── recover/"
msgstr ""
"<datastore>/mvm-hb/<cluster_uuid>-2/<host_hash>/\n"
"  ├── hb.properties\n"
"  ├── *.xml          (VM-Definitionen)\n"
"  └── recover/"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:96
msgid "APD (All Paths Down) Protection"
msgstr "APD (All Paths Down)-Schutz"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:98
msgid ""
"APD protection prevents split-brain data corruption when a host loses "
"access to shared storage."
msgstr ""
"Der APD-Schutz verhindert Split-Brain-Datenbeschädigung, wenn ein Host den "
"Zugriff auf den gemeinsamen Speicher verliert."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:100
msgid ""
"After 6 consecutive failed heartbeat writes (~2 minutes), all non-pinned "
"VMs on shared storage are shut down"
msgstr ""
"Nach 6 aufeinanderfolgenden fehlgeschlagenen Heartbeat-Schreibvorgängen (~2 Minuten) "
"werden alle nicht angehefteten VMs auf dem gemeinsamen Speicher heruntergefahren"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/architecture.rst:101
msgid ""
"This prevents VMs from running with stale data while another host may be "
"serving the same storage"
msgstr ""
"Dies verhindert, dass VMs mit veralteten Daten laufen, während ein anderer Host "
"möglicherweise denselben Speicher bereitstellt"

